          },
          "items": [
            {
              "name": "ref",
              "type": "tag",
              "attrs": {
                "loc": "ACT.13.10"
              },
              "items": [
                {
                  "text": "Byak 13:10",
                  "type": "text"
                }
              ]
            },
            {
              "name": "ref",
              "type": "tag",
              "attrs": {
                "loc": "2PE.2.14"
              },
              "items": [
                {
                  "text": "2 Pet 2:14",
                  "type": "text"
                }
              ]
            },
            {
              "text": ",",
              "type": "text"
            },
            {
              "name": "ref",
              "type": "tag",
              "attrs": {
                "loc": "2PE.2.15"
              },
              "items": [
                {
                  "text": "15",
                  "type": "text"
                }
              ]
            },
            {
              "text": ".",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " Maraika wa MUKAMA yaamubuuza ati: Waateerera ki endogoya yaawe egi mirundi yonshatu? Reeba, naija kukutanga omu maisho, ahabw'okuba orugyendo oru orimu n'orw'obugomi omu maisho gangye; ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NUM.22.32",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NUM.22.32"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "33",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "NUM 22:33"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "33",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "endogoya yaawe ku yandeeba, yampigiza egyo mirundi eshatu; kuri etampigiza, buzimazima hati kuri naakwitsire, yo ngireka ehuriire. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NUM.22.33",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NUM.22.33"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "34",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "NUM 22:34"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "34",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "name": "note",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "x",
            "caller": "#"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "name": "ref",
              "type": "tag",
              "attrs": {
                "loc": "1SA.26.21"
              },
              "items": [
                {
                  "text": "1 Sam 26:21",
                  "type": "text"
                }
              ]
            },
            {
              "text": ".",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " Balamu yaagarukamu maraika wa MUKAMA ati: Naacumura, ahakuba naaba ntamanyire ku onyemereire omu maisho kuntanga; mbwenu ku kiraabe nikikugwisa kubi, naaza kugarukayo. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NUM.22.34",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NUM.22.34"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "35",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "NUM 22:35"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "35",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Maraika wa MUKAMA yaagira Balamu ati: Irooko ogyende n'abo bashaija; kwonka ekigambo eki ndaakugambire, obe nikyo waagamba. Atyo Balamu yaagumizamu, yaagyenda n'abanyiginya ba Balaki. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NUM.22.35",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NUM.22.35"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "36",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "NUM 22:36"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "36",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Balaki ku yaahuriire ngu Balamu yaija, yaaza kumubugana omu rurembo rwa Moabu, orwabaire ruri aha mwatano gwa Arunooni, ahu ogwo mwatano gurikugarukira. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NUM.22.36",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NUM.22.36"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "37",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "NUM 22:37"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "37",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Balaki yaagira Balamu ati: Tindakutumireho kukweta? N'enki ekyakuzibiire kwija? Torikumanya ku ndikubaasa kukukuza nkakuhindura omuntu w'ekitiinisa? ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NUM.22.37",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NUM.22.37"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "38",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "NUM 22:38"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "38",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "name": "note",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "x",
            "caller": "#"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "name": "ref",
              "type": "tag",
              "attrs": {
                "loc": "2CH.18.13"
              },
              "items": [
                {
                  "text": "2 Bus 18:13",
                  "type": "text"
                }
              ]
            },
            {
              "text": ".",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " Balamu yaagarukamu Balaki ati: Reeba, mbwenu naija; noogira ngu nyine obushoboorozi bwona kugira eki naagamba ahabwangye? Ekigambo eki Ruhanga araate omu kanwa kangye, nikyo ndaagambe. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NUM.22.38",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NUM.22.38"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "39",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "NUM 22:39"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "39",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Balamu yaagyenda na Balaki, baahika Kiryasi-huzoosi. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NUM.22.39",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NUM.22.39"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "40",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "NUM 22:40"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "40",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Balaki yaatamba ebitambo by'ente n'entaama, yaatwekyeraho Balamu n'abanyiginya abaizire nawe.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NUM.22.40",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NUM.22.40"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
