        {
          "text": " Ku bwaseesire, Balaki yaatwara Balamu yaamwinamura omu kibungo ekirikwetwa Bamosi-baali; yaareebera okwo orubaju rumwe orw'Abaisraeli orwabaire rumuri haihi.",
